      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Fairbourne Station, named after early settler Joseph Fairbourne, is the planned downtown hub anchored by a civic center and TRAX Green Line station.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
